{"type":"message","id":"e32bf61d","parentId":"4f6f44c2","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:40:03.933Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我已经了解了项目的当前状态。这是一个已有的 FSRS 记忆系统，有基本的 Web UI 和 API。现在需要进行全面重构，目标是打造功能完善、界面美观的 WEB 版 ANKI 应用。\n\n由于 team-task skill 不存在，我需要手动协调各个 agent。让我先启动 search-agent 进行调研工作。\n\n我需要：\n1. 创建 search-agent 会话，进行调研\n2. 调研内容包括：开源 FSRS 实现、ANKI 卡包解析库、优秀 Web 学习应用案例\n\n让我先查看一下 web 目录下的更多细节，然后启动 search-agent。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5b424d7c715e4cb6af56a3e5","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public/index.html"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b576f1ffa7184062afcc15c6","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/server.js","limit":100}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b14080ac792246588dca3adb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/one/projects/chinese_medicine.apkg 2>/dev/null || echo \"APKG file not found\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":12929,"output":406,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13335,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772177994934}}
{"type":"message","id":"aa4c3d6f","parentId":"e32bf61d","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:40:03.943Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5b424d7c715e4cb6af56a3e5","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>FSRS Memory - 间隔重复学习</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"app\">\n    <!-- Sidebar -->\n    <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">\n        <span class=\"logo-icon\">🧠</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-text\">FSRS Memory</span>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Theme Toggle -->\n      <div class=\"theme-toggle\">\n        <button class=\"theme-btn\" id=\"theme-toggle-btn\" onclick=\"toggleTheme()\">\n          <span id=\"theme-icon\">🌙</span>\n          <span id=\"theme-text\">切换主题</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      \n      <!-- Deck Selector -->\n      <div class=\"deck-selector\">\n        <div class=\"deck-selector-label\">当前牌组</div>\n        <select class=\"deck-select\" id=\"deck-select\" onchange=\"changeDeck(this.value)\">\n          <option value=\"\">全部牌组</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n      \n      <nav class=\"nav-menu\">\n        <button class=\"nav-item active\" data-view=\"study\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">📖</span>\n          <span>学习</span>\n          <span class=\"badge\" id=\"due-badge\">0</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"cards\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">📚</span>\n          <span>卡片</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"decks\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">🗂️</span>\n          <span>牌组</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"add\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">➕</span>\n          <span>添加</span>\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"nav-item\" data-view=\"stats\">\n          <span class=\"nav-icon\">📊</span>\n          <span>统计</span>\n        </button>\n      </nav>\n      \n      <div class=\"sidebar-stats\">\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"total-cards\">0</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">总卡片</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-item\">\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"due-cards\">0</span>\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">待复习</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"main-content\">\n      <!-- Study View -->\n      <section id=\"study-view\" class=\"view active\">\n        <div class=\"study-header\">\n          <h1>今日复习</h1>\n          <div class=\"study-progress\">\n            <span id=\"study-progress\">0 / 0</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"deck-info\" id=\"deck-info\"></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"study-container\" id=\"study-container\">\n          <!-- Card will be loaded here -->\n          <div class=\"empty-state\" id=\"no-cards-message\">\n            <div class=\"empty-icon\">🎉</div>\n            <h2>太棒了！</h2>\n            <p>今天没有需要复习的卡片了</p>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"showView('add')\">添加新卡片</button>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"card-area\" id=\"card-area\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"card-header\">\n                <span class=\"card-id\">#<span id=\"card-id\">0</span></span>\n                <span class=\"card-state\" id=\"card-state\">new</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card-content\">\n                <div class=\"card-front\" id=\"card-front\">\n                  <div class=\"card-label\">问题</div>\n                  <div class=\"card-text\" id=\"question-text\">加载中...</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-back\" id=\"card-back\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                  <div class=\"card-label\">答案</div>\n                  <div class=\"card-text\" id=\"answer-text\">加载中...</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card-footer\">\n                <button class=\"btn btn-hint\" id=\"show-answer-btn\" onclick=\"showAnswer()\">显示答案</button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"rating-buttons\" id=\"rating-buttons\" style=\"display: none;\">\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-again\" onclick=\"rateCard(1)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Again</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-1\">1m</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-hard\" onclick=\"rateCard(2)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Hard</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-2\">10m</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-good\" onclick=\"rateCard(3)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Good</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-3\">1d</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-easy\" onclick=\"rateCard(4)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Easy</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-4\">4d</span>\n              </button>\n              <button class=\"rating-btn rating-perfect\" onclick=\"rateCard(5)\">\n                <span class=\"rating-label\">Perfect</span>\n                <span class=\"rating-interval\" id=\"interval-5\">10d</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Cards List View -->\n      <section id=\"cards-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>所有卡片</h1>\n          <div class=\"search-box\">\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"card-search\" placeholder=\"搜索卡片...\" oninput=\"filterCards()\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"cards-list\" id=\"cards-list\">\n          <!-- Cards will be loaded here -->\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Decks View -->\n      <section id=\"decks-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>牌组管理</h1>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"showCreateDeckModal()\">➕ 新建牌组</button>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"decks-grid\" id=\"decks-grid\">\n          <!-- Decks will be loaded here -->\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Add Card View -->\n      <section id=\"add-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>添加卡片</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"add-form\">\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"deck-select-add\">选择牌组</label>\n            <select id=\"deck-select-add\">\n              <!-- Options populated by JS -->\n            </select>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"question-input\">问题</label>\n            <textarea id=\"question-input\" placeholder=\"输入问题...\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"answer-input\">答案</label>\n            <textarea id=\"answer-input\" placeholder=\"输入答案...\" rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          \n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-large\" onclick=\"addCard()\">添加卡片</button>\n          \n          <div class=\"quick-add\">\n            <h3>快速添加 (格式: 问题::答案)</h3>\n            <textarea id=\"quick-add-input\" placeholder=\"每行一个卡片，格式: 问题::答案\" rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"quickAdd()\">批量添加</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Stats View -->\n      <section id=\"stats-view\" class=\"view\">\n        <div class=\"view-header\">\n          <h1>学习统计</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">📚</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-total\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">总卡片数</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card stat-due\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">⏰</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-due\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">待复习</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card stat-done\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">✅</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-reviewed\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">已复习</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">🆕</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-new\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">新卡片</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">📈</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-learning\">0</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">学习中</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat-card\">\n            <div class=\"stat-icon\">🎯</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-number\" id=\"stat-ease\">2.5</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-title\">平均难度</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"stats-chart\">\n          <h3>学习进度</h3>\n          <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n            <div class=\"progress-segment\" id=\"progress-new\" style=\"background: #3498db; width: 0%\"></div>\n            <div class=\"progress-segment\" id=\"progress-learning\" style=\"background: #f39c12; width: 0%\"></div>\n            <div class=\"progress-segment\" id=\"progress-review\" style=\"background: #27ae60; width: 0%\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"progress-legend\">\n            <span><span class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background: #3498db\"></span> 新卡片</span>\n            <span><span class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background: #f39c12\"></span> 学习</span>\n            <span><span class=\"legend-dot\" style=\"background: #27ae60\"></span> 复习</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Delete Confirmation Modal -->\n  <div class=\"modal\" id=\"delete-modal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <h3>确认删除</h3>\n      <p>确定要删除这张卡片吗？此操作无法撤销。</p>\n      <div class=\"modal-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"closeModal()\">取消</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-danger\" id=\"confirm-delete-btn\">删除</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Deck Modal -->\n  <div class=\"modal\" id=\"deck-modal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <h3 id=\"deck-modal-title\">新建牌组</h3>\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <label for=\"deck-name-input\">牌组名称</label>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"deck-name-input\" placeholder=\"输入牌组名称...\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <label for=\"deck-desc-input\">描述（可选）</label>\n        <textarea id=\"deck-desc-input\" placeholder=\"输入牌组描述...\" rows=\"2\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"closeDeckModal()\">取消</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"save-deck-btn\">保存</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Toast Notification -->\n  <div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\"></div>\n\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772178003940}}
{"type":"message","id":"9102f4b7","parentId":"aa4c3d6f","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:40:03.950Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b576f1ffa7184062afcc15c6","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// server.js - Express Backend for FSRS Web UI with Multi-deck & Theme support\nconst express = require('express');\nconst cors = require('cors');\nconst path = require('path');\nconst Database = require('better-sqlite3');\n\nconst app = express();\nconst PORT = process.env.PORT || 3001;\n\n// Middleware\napp.use(cors());\napp.use(express.json());\napp.use(express.static(path.join(__dirname, 'public')));\n\n// Database setup - connect to existing cards.db\nconst DB_PATH = process.env.DB_PATH || path.join(__dirname, '..', 'data', 'cards.db');\nconst db = new Database(DB_PATH);\n\n// Import FSRS engine\nconst FSRSEngine = require('../src/fsrs');\n\n// ==================== Database Helper Functions ====================\n\n// Fix inconsistent state values in database\nfunction fixCardStates() {\n  try {\n    // Fix \"2.0\" state to \"review\" (this was a bug where State.Review = 2 was stored as string)\n    const result = db.prepare(\"UPDATE cards SET state = 'review' WHERE state = '2.0'\").run();\n    if (result.changes > 0) {\n      console.log(`Fixed ${result.changes} cards with invalid state '2.0'`);\n    }\n    \n    // Fix empty or null states to \"new\"\n    db.prepare(\"UPDATE cards SET state = 'new' WHERE state IS NULL OR state = ''\").run();\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Error fixing card states:', error);\n  }\n}\n\n// Run state fix on startup\nfixCardStates();\n\n// Get current local time for database queries\nfunction getLocalNow() {\n  return new Date().toISOString();\n}\n\n// ==================== Settings API ====================\n\n// Get theme\napp.get('/api/settings/theme', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const theme = db.prepare(\"SELECT value FROM settings WHERE key = 'theme'\").get();\n    res.json({ success: true, data: theme ? theme.value : 'light' });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Set theme\napp.post('/api/settings/theme', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { theme } = req.body;\n    if (!theme || !['light', 'dark'].includes(theme)) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'Invalid theme' });\n    }\n    db.prepare(`\n      INSERT INTO settings (key, value) VALUES ('theme', ?)\n      ON CONFLICT(key) DO UPDATE SET value = excluded.value\n    `).run(theme);\n    res.json({ success: true, data: theme });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// ==================== Deck API ====================\n\n// Get all decks\napp.get('/api/decks', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    // Use localtime for due_date comparison to match user timezone\n    const decks = db.prepare(`\n      SELECT d.*, \n        (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM cards WHERE deck_id = d.id) as card_count,\n        (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM cards WHERE deck_id = d.id AND strftime('%s', due_date) <= strftime('%s', 'now')) as due_count\n      FROM decks d \n      ORDER BY d.id ASC\n    `).all();\n    res.json({ success: true, data: decks });\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });\n  }\n});\n\n// Get single deck\napp.get('/api/decks/:id', (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const deck = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM decks WHERE id = ?').get(req.params.id);\n    if (!deck) {\n\n[352 more lines in file. Use offset=101 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772178003948}}
