{"type":"message","id":"d6c9113c","parentId":"d3adad1b","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:43:27.087Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我现在对项目有了全面了解：\n\n**当前状态**：\n- 后端：Express + better-sqlite3 + ts-fsrs\n- 前端：原生 HTML/CSS/JavaScript（无框架）\n- 功能：多牌组、主题切换、基本学习功能\n- 缺少：APKG 导入、美观的 UI、完整的学习流程\n\n**重构目标**：\n1. 引入开源 FSRS 实现 ✅（已使用 ts-fsrs）\n2. 专注 WEB 功能和美化 - 需要改进 UI/UX\n3. 支持 ANKI 卡包导入 - 需要实现 .apkg 解析\n4. 可切换技术路线 - 考虑是否引入现代前端框架\n\n让我开始制定详细的重构计划并逐步实现。首先，我需要搜索 APKG 文件格式和解析方法。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_688cc13a83ac44f1b9a8c4d0","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://github.com/ankitects/anki/blob/main/docs/develop.md","maxChars":5000}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_77c726233b70457eaae2f2f6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"npm search apkg --json 2>/dev/null | head -50 || echo \"Search failed\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":27138,"output":464,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27602,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772178202710}}
