{"type":"message","id":"ade2c933","parentId":"3156d39f","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:46:53.103Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_e5640ff99f3b4fc986b4a583","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# APKG Reader\n\nJavaScript library for reading the [APKG][0] format.\n\n# What is an APKG file?\n> An APKG file is a custom deck of flashcards created for use in Anki, a flashcard-based studying program. It contains HTML data used for card presentation as well as text, images, and sounds. Users can create their own Anki flashcard decks or import others' by selecting the Create Deck or Get Shared buttons found in the app.\n[Source][0]\n\n## Usage\n\n```ts\nimport { readDatabaseFrom, ZipHandler } from \"apkg-reader.js\";\n\nconst data =  new ZipHandler(\"path/to/apkg\")\nconst db = await readDatabaseFrom(data);\n```\n\n[0]: https://fileinfo.com/extension/apkg#:~:text=An%20APKG%20file%20is%20a,text%2C%20images%2C%20and%20sounds."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":10,"aggregated":"# APKG Reader\n\nJavaScript library for reading the [APKG][0] format.\n\n# What is an APKG file?\n> An APKG file is a custom deck of flashcards created for use in Anki, a flashcard-based studying program. It contains HTML data used for card presentation as well as text, images, and sounds. Users can create their own Anki flashcard decks or import others' by selecting the Create Deck or Get Shared buttons found in the app.\n[Source][0]\n\n## Usage\n\n```ts\nimport { readDatabaseFrom, ZipHandler } from \"apkg-reader.js\";\n\nconst data =  new ZipHandler(\"path/to/apkg\")\nconst db = await readDatabaseFrom(data);\n```\n\n[0]: https://fileinfo.com/extension/apkg#:~:text=An%20APKG%20file%20is%20a,text%2C%20images%2C%20and%20sounds.","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772178413099}}
{"type":"message","id":"0c3b408f","parentId":"ade2c933","timestamp":"2026-02-27T07:47:02.483Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我了解了 apkg-reader 的基本用法。现在让我创建一个 APKG 导入模块。首先查看一下 APKG 文件的结构，然后实现导入功能。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1fef4a6784dc418bb9ace463","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory && node -e \"\nconst { readDatabaseFrom, ZipHandler } = require('apkg-reader');\nconst path = require('path');\n\nasync function test() {\n  try {\n    const apkgPath = '/home/one/projects/chinese_medicine.apkg';\n    console.log('Testing APKG reader with:', apkgPath);\n    \n    const data = new ZipHandler(apkgPath);\n    const db = await readDatabaseFrom(data);\n    \n    // Get tables\n    const tables = db.prepare(\\\"SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='table'\\\").all();\n    console.log('Tables:', tables.map(t => t.name));\n    \n    // Get notes count\n    const notesCount = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM notes').get();\n    console.log('Notes count:', notesCount);\n    \n    // Get cards count  \n    const cardsCount = db.prepare('SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM cards').get();\n    console.log('Cards count:', cardsCount);\n    \n    // Sample note\n    const sampleNote = db.prepare('SELECT * FROM notes LIMIT 1').get();\n    console.log('Sample note:', JSON.stringify(sampleNote, null, 2));\n    \n    db.close();\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('Error:', error.message);\n  }\n}\n\ntest();\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":35187,"output":406,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35593,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772178413104}}
